if (++port->sysrq_seq < sysrq_toggle_seq_len) {
```
Reason:
By using `strlen(sysrq_toggle_seq)` instead of `ARRAY_SIZE(sysrq_toggle_seq)`, the code accurately calculates the actual length of the string without including the null terminator. This change resolves the compiler warning and ensures that the comparison is valid, allowing the function to operate correctly based on the actual length of the string.


